<!--
  two_lane_merge — hand-authored for osc2r2 (see maps/README.md).

  A one-way two-lane carriageway with an on-ramp merging from the right, then a
  banked 250 m-radius curve on a 4 m grade. Everything is drawn in the map's own
  local frame: there is deliberately no <geoReference>, the map is not a copy of
  any real place.

  Geometry element anchors are chained, so each element starts where the previous
  one ends with the same heading (tests/maps.rs pins that there is no kink).

-->
